## Upgrade

Refresh the tool, then let it re-render the files it owns:

```bash
uv tool install --upgrade forge-django
forge-django upgrade
```

> **Command rename (0.4):** the tool is now `forge-django`. Replace any
> `forge …` scripts, aliases or CI steps with `forge-django …`; generated
> project files are unaffected by the rename.
